  "goodToKnow": "Der Redner (die Rednerin) is a speaker or orator: ein guter Redner, der Gastredner (guest speaker), die Rednerliste (list of speakers) in parliament. They stand at das Rednerpult (lectern). Die Rede is a speech: eine Rede halten (to give a speech). In the Bundestag, the Bundestagspräsident calls each Redner and can cut off their microphone if they run over time. From reden (to talk)."
